'''Ornament''' is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife that is currently obtainable by giving 100 [[Gifts]] {{Currency|Gift}} (equivalent to a total of 60,000 [[Snow Tokens]] {{Currency|Snow Token}}) to players during the [[Christmas Event 2025|2025 Christmas Event]], or by [[trading]].

== Appearance ==
It's a red knife that closely resembles the [[Bauble]] gun from the [[Christmas Event 2024|2024 Christmas Event]]. It has a golden star right below a red bauble-like sphere that connects the red handle to the striped blade with white patterns.

== Trivia ==
* It has a chroma counterpart under the name [[Chroma Ornament]].
* It is the seventh [[Godly Weapons|godly]] weapon to be obtained from gifting, the others being [[Lugercane]], [[Jinglegun]], [[Swirly Blade]], [[Gingermint]], [[Evergun]], and [[Bauble]].
* This, its [[Chroma Ornament|chroma counterpart]], and [[Swirly Blade]] are currently the only knives obtainable through gifting.
* It partners with the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun [[Bauble]], making the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Ornament Set|Ornament Set]].
* Although it's [[Bauble|partner gun]] was released on 2024, the Ornament Set was finally completed on the [[Christmas Event 2025|Christmas 2025]].

